Summon Elemental Follow
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ===================================== --------
        -------- NAZGREK GROUP --------
        Set VariableSet SummonElemental_NTempPoint = (Position of Nazgrek)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit is alive) Equal to True
                (Distance between (Position of SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit) and SummonElemental_NTempPoint) Greater than 600.00
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Order SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit to Right-Click Nazgrek
            Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Current order of Nazgrek) Equal to (Order(attack))
                        (Current order of SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit to Right-Click Nazgrek
                    Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Current order of SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit) Not equal to (Order(smart))
                            Then - Actions
                                Unit - Order SummonElemental_NazgrekUnit to Right-Click Nazgrek
                            Else - Actions
